SelectorShape.description:
Selection across the range. `square`: units inside are fully selected (partly at the
edges); `ramp_up`: 0 at the start to 1 at the end, 1 after it; `ramp_down`: the opposite;
`triangle`: 1 in the middle, 0 at both edges; `round`: half circle; `smooth`: bell curve.

SetCleanVoice.description:
Clean the voice of audio clips: removes background noise (hiss, hum, fan) from speech with
a noise reduction made for voices. `amount` from 0 (off, the default) to 1 (strongest);
0.8 is a good start. Applies to the whole clip. Example: `{clips: ["voice"], amount: 0.8}`.
